[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0009","text":"女仆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0010","text":"为您送上所点的餐品\n这是当季红茶与司康饼的套餐──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0020","text":"那么，请慢慢享用"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0030","text":"……谢、谢谢您……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0040","text":"……她的举止真的好优雅啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0050","text":"嗯……！总觉得……好帅气！\n虽然不知道用『帅气』合不合适……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0060","text":"……嗯，认真工作的样子\n真的非常帅气呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0070","text":"是啊\n────来吃吧，趁还没凉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0080","text":"……嗯，这红茶好香\n司康饼配果酱和奶油也超搭的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0090","text":"应该是很多人\n认真工作的成果吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0100","text":"……认真细致的工作……\n感觉好像从中获得了力量……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100200_02_0102","text":"Motion"}]
